{"id":"ch06","number":"6","title":"乙太網路交換（二）","en":"Ethernet LAN Switching · Part 2","start":26,"end":29,"domain":"fundamentals","topics":["mac","arp"],"scope":"core","order":6,"pages":[{"page":26,"image":"/data/pdf/pages/0026.jpg","blocks":[{"en":"6. ETHERNET LAN SWITCHING : PART 2","source":"text","id":"p26-b1","segments":[{"en":"6.","zh":"6.","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"ETHERNET LAN SWITCHING : PART 2","zh":"乙醚網LAN交換:部分2","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"6.\n乙醚網LAN交換:部分2","kind":"prose"},{"en":"An ETHERNET FRAME looks like: \nEthernet Header --- DATA (Packet) --- Ethernet Trailer","source":"text","id":"p26-b2","segments":[{"en":"An ETHERNET FRAME looks like:","zh":"乙醚網訊框看起來像:","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"Ethernet Header --- DATA (Packet) --- Ethernet Trailer","zh":"乙太網標頭-- -- 資料封包) -- -- -- 乙太網拖車","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2}],"zh":"乙醚網訊框看起來像:\n乙太網標頭-- -- 資料封包) -- -- -- 乙太網拖車","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Eth.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b3","segments":[{"en":"Eth.","zh":"愛思.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"愛思.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Eth.","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b4","segments":[{"en":"Eth.","zh":"愛思.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"愛思.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Packet","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b5","segments":[{"en":"Packet","zh":"封包","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"封包","kind":"prose"},{"en":"header","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b6","segments":[{"en":"header","zh":"標頭","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"標頭","kind":"prose"},{"en":"trailer","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b7","segments":[{"en":"trailer","zh":"拖車","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"拖車","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Preamble SFD Destination","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b8","segments":[{"en":"Preamble SFD Destination","zh":"序言 sfd 目的端","method":"local-mt","version":2}],"zh":"序言 sfd 目的端","kind":"prose"},{"en":"FCS","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b9","segments":[{"en":"FCS","zh":"FCS","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"FCS","kind":"prose"},{"en":"Source Type","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b10","segments":[{"en":"Source Type","zh":"來源 型別","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"來源 型別","kind":"prose"},{"en":"The Ethernet Header contains 5 Fields: \nPreamble -- SFD -- Destination -- Source -- Type/Length 7 bytes -- 1 byte -- 6 bytes -- 6 bytes -- 2 bytes \nEthernet Trailer contains 1 Field: \nFCS (Frame Check Sequence) = 4 bytes","source":"text","id":"p26-b11","segments":[{"en":"The Ethernet Header contains 5 Fields:","zh":"乙太網標頭包含5欄位:","method":"local-mt"},{"en":"Preamble -- SFD -- Destination -- Source -- Type/Length 7 bytes -- 1 byte -- 6 bytes -- 6 bytes -- 2 bytes Ethernet Trailer contains 1 Field:","zh":"序言 -- -- sfd -- --目的端 -- 來源-- -- 型別/長度7位元組 --1位元組 --6位元組 --6位元組 --2乙太網拖車包含位元組1欄位 :","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2},{"en":"FCS (Frame Check Sequence) = 4 bytes","zh":"FCS (訊框檢查順序) =4位元組","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments"}],"zh":"乙太網標頭包含5欄位:\n序言 -- -- sfd -- --目的端 -- 來源-- -- 型別/長度7位元組 --1位元組 --6位元組 --6位元組 --2乙太網拖車包含位元組1欄位 :\nFCS (訊框檢查順序) =4位元組","kind":"prose"},{"en":"• \nThe PREAMBLE + SFD is not usually considered part of the ETHERNET HEADER. \nTHEREFORE the size of the ETHERNET HEADER + TRAILER is 18 bytes \n(6 + 6 + 2 + 4 bytes for the FRAME CHECK SEQUENCE)","source":"text","id":"p26-b12","segments":[{"en":"•","zh":"•","method":"verbatim"},{"en":"The PREAMBLE + SFD is not usually considered part of the ETHERNET HEADER.","zh":"序言+ sfd通常不被認為是醚網的一部分標頭.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"THEREFORE the size of the ETHERNET HEADER + TRAILER is 18 bytes (6 + 6 + 2 + 4 bytes for the FRAME CHECK SEQUENCE)","zh":"因此,乙醚網的大小標頭+ 拖車18位元組數 (E)6 + 6 + 2 + 4位元組訊框檢查序列)","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2}],"zh":"•\n序言+ sfd通常不被認為是醚網的一部分標頭.\n因此,乙醚網的大小標頭+ 拖車18位元組數 (E)6 + 6 + 2 + 4位元組訊框檢查序列)","kind":"prose"},{"en":"The MINIMUM size for an ETHERNET FRAME (Header + Payload [PACKET] + Trailer) is 64 BYTES. \n64 BYTES - 18 BYTES (Header + Trailer size) = 46 BYTES \nTHEREFORE the MINIMUM DATA PAYLOAD (PACKET) size is 46 BYTES! \nIF the PAYLOAD is LESS than 46 BYTES then PADDING BYTES are added (padding bytes are a series \nof 0's) until it equals to 46 BYTES.","source":"text","id":"p26-b13","segments":[{"en":"The MINIMUM size for an ETHERNET FRAME (Header + Payload [PACKET] + Trailer) is 64 BYTES.","zh":"乙醚網訊框(標頭+酬載封包+拖拉機)的最小尺寸為64位元組.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"64 BYTES - 18 BYTES (Header + Trailer size) = 46 BYTES THEREFORE the MINIMUM DATA PAYLOAD (PACKET) size is 46 BYTES!","zh":"64位元組 - 18位元組 (標頭 + 有軌電車大小) = 46位元組,因此最小資料 酬載 (封包) 大小為 46位元組!","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"IF the PAYLOAD is LESS than 46 BYTES then PADDING BYTES are added (padding bytes are a series","zh":"如果 酬載 的位元組小於 46 位元組, 則新增編碼位元組( 位元組是一個序列)","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"of 0's) until it equals to 46 BYTES.","zh":"聯 合 國0's),直到它等於:46位元組。","method":"local-mt-protected-fragments","version":2}],"zh":"乙醚網訊框(標頭+酬載封包+拖拉機)的最小尺寸為64位元組.\n64位元組 - 18位元組 (標頭 + 有軌電車大小) = 46位元組,因此最小資料 酬載 (封包) 大小為 46位元組!\n如果 酬載 的位元組小於 46 位元組, 則新增編碼位元組( 位元組是一個序列)\n聯 合 國0's),直到它等於:46位元組。","kind":"prose"},{"en":"When a PC sends a packet to a device with an unknown IP address, it uses an ARP Request.","source":"text","id":"p26-b14","segments":[{"en":"When a PC sends a packet to a device with an unknown IP address, it uses an ARP Request.","zh":"當一個PC傳送一個封包到一個未知IP address的裝置時,它使用一個ARP請求.","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"當一個PC傳送一個封包到一個未知IP address的裝置時,它使用一個ARP請求.","kind":"prose"},{"en":"ARP Request","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b15","segments":[{"en":"ARP Request","zh":"ARP 請求","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"ARP 請求","kind":"prose"},{"en":"MAC: OC2F. Bell. 9Doe","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b16","segments":[{"en":"MAC: OC2F.","zh":"MAC:oc2f.","method":"local-mt","version":2},{"en":"Bell. 9Doe","zh":"貝爾。 9 doe","method":"local-mt"}],"zh":"MAC:oc2f.\n貝爾。 9 doe","kind":"prose"},{"en":"MAC: OC2F. B06A.3900","source":"image-ocr","id":"p26-b17","segments":[{"en":"MAC: OC2F